        "pos": [
          0,
          460
        ],
        "label": null,
        "params": {
          "text": "### Where a mark goes\n\n`right`, `above`, `below` and `in` — and `left`, which is where the one icon a cell used to hold always went.\n\nThe **late** rows are taller than the others: a mark `above` takes a line of its own, and only the rows that matched the rule pay for it.",
          "width": 620,
          "height": 180
        },
        "code": null
      },
      {
        "id": "n10_from",
        "type": "flograph.util.goto_from",
        "pos": [
          0,
          920
        ],
        "label": "jobs",
        "params": {
          "source": "n01_goto"
        },
        "code": null
      },
      {
        "id": "n11_table",
        "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
        "pos": [
          420,
          760
        ],
        "label": "1 · Where a mark goes",
        "params": {
          "format_rules": "score  icons traffic right\nlate   = 1 => icon ! amber above\nsigned = 1 => icon ✓ green in\nsigned = 0 => icon ✗ red in\njob    width 130\n",
          "width": 620,
          "height": 340
        },
        "code": null
      },
      {
        "id": "n29_note",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          0,
          1260
        ],
        "label": null,
        "params": {
          "text": "### More than one, in the same cell\n\nTwo rules that both match both land. This is the whole model change: a cell holds a **list**, so the second rule *adds* a mark rather than failing to replace the first.\n\nLook at **late** on the breached rows — an OT badge, the value, and a tick after it.",
          "width": 620,
          "height": 180
        },
        "code": null
      },
      {
        "id": "n20_from",
        "type": "flograph.util.goto_from",
        "pos": [
          0,
          1720
        ],
        "label": "jobs",
        "params": {
          "source": "n01_goto"
        },
        "code": null
      },
      {
        "id": "n21_table",
        "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
        "pos": [
          420,
          1560
        ],
        "label": "2 · More than one, in the same cell",
        "params": {
          "format_rules": "late   = 1 => pill red \"OT\"\nlate   = 1 => icon ✓ green right\nstatus = breach => icon ▲ red left\njob    width 130\n",
          "width": 620,
          "height": 340
        },
        "code": null
      },
      {
        "id": "n39_note",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          0,
          2060
        ],
        "label": null,
        "params": {
          "text": "### Pills\n\nA lozenge. With no text of its own it wraps the value (`status`); with text it stands beside it.\n\n`colormap pill:` is the category-pill shape — the mapped colour becomes the ground behind the value instead of flooding the cell.",
          "width": 620,
          "height": 180
        },
        "code": null
      },
      {
