    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "p01",
        "title": "On paper",
        "kind": "report",
        "body": "# Decorations on paper\n\nThe same rules, rendered as a document. A mark keeps its place, a\nrow that grew stays grown — and a pill prints square-cornered,\nbecause Qt's rich text has no `border-radius`. The colour carries\nthe meaning; the shape is the one thing the page cannot keep.\n\n## 1 · Where a mark goes\n\n![[1 · Where a mark goes]]\n\n## 2 · More than one, in the same cell\n\n![[2 · More than one, in the same cell]]\n\n## 3 · Pills\n\n![[3 · Pills]]\n"
      }
    ]
